- make the file tree look better
- fix library pane
- speed fixes and ui cleanups

This is a big refactor, if there are problems you should revert to the old one and delete your database
MacOS: Open finder Cmd+Shift+G, type `~/Library/Application Support/nicegal`, delete the folder
Linux: Delete `.config/nicegal`
Windows: Win+R, type %APPDATA%, delete `nicegal`
